\section{Bradley-Terry Goodness of Fit and Stratified Analysis}
\label{app:bt_gof}

Bradley-Terry goodness-of-fit tests confirm adequate model fit for both axes (formality: deviance $= 52.80$, $\text{df} = 45$, $p = 0.198$; verbosity: $p = 0.905$).
